# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository -- the public one, on GitHub -- publishes the finished books
# and nothing else. One folder per adaptation, and inside each, only render/.
#
#   MistbornD&D/render/       the Mistborn book, its art, its versions
#   StormlightD&D/render/     the next one, when there is one
#
# Everything else in each folder (the design notes in content/, the wiki, the
# raw sources, the build scripts, the edit passes) stays local and private.
# Ignore everything, then re-include only what is meant to be published.
#
# Local and private does not mean unversioned. Each adaptation keeps a SECOND
# repository, whose git directory is .gitlocal/ inside that folder and which is
# never pushed anywhere, holding the history of its private files. See
# VAULT-HISTORY.md in each. They are ignored here along with everything else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ignore everything
/*

# except the repository's own papers
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# and, inside each adaptation, only the finished book
!MistbornD&D/
MistbornD&D/*
!MistbornD&D/render/

!StormlightD&D/
StormlightD&D/*
!StormlightD&D/render/

# never the scratch that tools leave behind
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tmp
